# LAUNCH CARD v2 (task launch-card-v2), ALWAYS-SHOW contract (2026-07-11): a reachable
# launch hands off to `lodor-wizard --launch-card --summoned <rom>` on EVERY launch — the
# old SMART (news-only) mode is gone from this lane (NextUI busybox has no `timeout`, so
# hold-to-summon could never fire; a card the user cannot summon must always appear). The
# old minui-list restore picker stays GONE. Asserts the exact rom path in the wizard argv
# (the `=>` arrow pins the WIZARD trace line) and that no picker ran.
desc fetch hook: reachable launch + LOCAL=older -> full card (--summoned) always, no picker
invoke prehook
config paired
romarg Roms/Game Boy Advance (GBA)/✓ Zelda.gba
sdfile+ Roms/Game Boy Advance (GBA)/✓ Zelda.gba
engine 0|202\t2026-07-02 08:00\tFlip\t33KB\n101\t2026-07-01 10:00\tBrick\t32KB\tCURRENT\nLOCAL=older
wizard 0|LAUNCHCARD mode=summoned shown=1 action=play evicted=0
expect_exit 0
expect_trace ENGINE --list-saves
expect_trace WIZARD --launch-card --summoned
expect_trace ✓ Zelda.gba => rc=0
expect_trace_absent LIST[
expect_log action=card
expect_log local=older
